    "text": "payment of maternity benefits for such number of daysimmediately after her confinement commencing fromthe day immediately after the date on which theaforesaid period of ten weeks or four weeks as the casemay be, ends.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
