      161.85,
      203.09,
      401.89,
      226.79
    ],
    "text": "4.Section 6 of the principal enactment is hereby repealedand the substitution therefor, of the following section:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      240.05,
      401.9,
      300.59
    ],
    "text": "6. Nothing in the provisions of section 5shall be deemed to entitle any woman workerto claim the maternity benefits referred to inthis Ordinance from more than one employerin respect of the same confinement.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
